# data/synthetic_events.csv is intentionally TRACKED, not ignored (Day
# 15 final productization fix). `generate_data.py --seed 42` reproduces
# every substantive field deterministically, but each transaction_id's
# uuid4() suffix is NOT determined by --seed -- a fresh `make data` run
# mints different suffixes every time. The entire Day 11-15 test/demo/
# frontend layer hardcodes specific transaction_ids from one realization
# of this file, so it must be a committed, frozen artifact rather than
# something regenerated per clone. Discovered by the Day 15 pre-merge
# branch dry run (a fresh clone + `make data` broke 60 tests that
# reference specific transaction_ids). See docs/architecture.md.
